{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "spanish", "appid": 548430, "month": "2022-09", "window": 4, "start_date": 1663977600, "end_date": 1664582399, "month_true_total": 57, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:08:44 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "123103721", "author": {"steamid": "76561198300247153", "personaname": "Reinneta", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198300247153/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 8183, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 214, "playtime_at_review": 1703, "last_played": 1787478453, "avatar": "d7ab954d89a583d1b3e5bae539a416d0030c6a92"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Guys did i hear-Rock and Stones-?\nthats its lands rock and stone\nrock and stone brothers\nrock and stone forever\nIf you dont rock and stone, you ain´t comming home\nfor rock and stone\nRock and stone in the heart", "timestamp_created": 1664576700, "timestamp_updated": 1664576700, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "123101048", "author": {"steamid": "76561199002665633", "personaname": "MrElioy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199002665633/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 3786, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 704, "last_played": 1746653010, "avatar": "235e6e10cd66af9a6c42020f8053cf3a32508522"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "ta bueno \naca tienen una receta de una choco torta \n\ningredientes (para una fuente mediana)\n400 gr de dulce de leche (si es repostero mucho mejor, sino no importa!)\n400 gr de crema de leche o natilla\n750 gr de galletitas de chocolate\nLeche o café para remojar las galletitas\n50 gr de chocolate (cobertura o de taza) semi amargo\n50 gr de cacao en polvo\n\nPaso a paso\nComenzar a batir el dulce de leche y cuando esté de un color más claro agregar la crema. Batir en el punto más bajo de la batidora hasta que esté a punto letra. Tener sumo cuidado en que no se pase del punto porque sino se corta! Si por esas tragedias de la vida se llegase a cortar: agregarle un chorrito de crema e integrar. Reservar a un costado.\n\nRemojar cada galletita y colocar en una fuente hasta formar una capa. Colocar una capa de la crema de dulce de leche. Otra capa de galletitas humedecidas y así 4 veces. Llevar a enfriar por 1 hora en refrigerador. Espolvorear con cacao en polvo. Al servir, rallar un poco de chocolate amargo por encima.\n", "timestamp_created": 1664573063, "timestamp_updated": 1664573063, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.444444417953491211", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "123087369", "author": {"steamid": "76561198199407983", "personaname": "antrocactus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198199407983/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 5232, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3783, "last_played": 1753241443, "avatar": "8527e7d2fac9e69c224c67b7f657062436c6844a"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Muy buen juego sobre todo coop con amigos, algo repetitivas las misiones pero ir desbloqueando items motiva a seguir.\nRecomendado.", "timestamp_created": 1664557770, "timestamp_updated": 1664557770, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_a